sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant L1 as ALP 1
    participant QA as Queue A
    participant QB as Queue B
    participant L2A as ALP 2 Consumer A
    participant L2B as ALP 2 Consumer B
    participant S2 as SRV 2

    L1->>QA: Alarmmeldung A
